{"title":"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Nebraska, the home of the AMC, changed its license plate scheme. Each old license plate consisted of a letter followed by four digits. Each new license plate consists of three letters followed by three digits. By how many times has the number of possible license plates increased?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/4/bf497546bff5909b4e6b98d9420941eaaaa51041.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\frac{26}{10} \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } \\frac{26^2}{10^2} \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } \\frac{26^2}{10} \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } \\frac{26^3}{10^3} \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } \\frac{26^3}{10^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"447\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bda00d9a38a0c6bd9aac2512c6d065581882d43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> letters and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> digits. There were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/3/213bd353c606cd242cba6a475faf6ce8a66db636.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26 \\cdot 10^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" /> old license plates. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/3/ab3a7bf7a7cefcce132fbade6a07ca261430cb77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26^3 \\cdot 10^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"17\" /> new license plates. The number of license plates increased by\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/e/bce4220f1b7d53e103e486a9453b3f8368d28bf8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{26^3 \\cdot 10^3}{26 \\cdot 10^4} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) \\ } \\frac{26^2}{10}}\\]\" width=\"173\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p>Note: Nebraska is not actually the home of the AMC, the AMC resides in Washington D.C., where its headquarters is located.\n</p><p>~Andrew_Lu, Mismatchedcubing\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B\">2003 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n